  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:196px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Divine_Hunter.jpg\" title=\"Divine Hunter\"><img alt=\"Divine Hunter\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"230\" src=\"/images/Divine_Hunter.jpg\" width=\"194\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Divine_Hunter.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Divine Hunter</div></div></div>\n<p><b>Race:</b>  Orok\n</p><p><b>Class:</b> Ranger\n</p><p>Orok Hunters are <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Warrior\" title=\"Orok Warrior\">Orok Warrior-sized</a> rangers armed with a bow.  They are much larger in size compared to <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Scout\" title=\"Orok Scout\">Orok Scouts</a> and are much tougher than their smaller ranger brethren.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Habitat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fledgling Hunter\n</td><td> --\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Embercore_Path\" title=\"The Embercore Path\">The Embercore Path</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Orok Cave Hunter\n</td><td> Shadow\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Balzack's_Burrow\" title=\"Balzack's Burrow\">Balzack's Burrow</a> Offs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Divine Hunter\n</td><td> Divine\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"The Mutanous Malaise\">The Mutanous Malaise</a> offs, <a href=\"/wiki/Balzack's_Burrow\" title=\"Balzack's Burrow\">Balzack's Burrow</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Poison Hunter\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td> --\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Chaos Hunter\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Mania\" title=\"Mutant Mania\">Mutant Mania</a> offs\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
